define user express greeting
  "hello"
  "hi"
  "hey"
  "hey Nova"
  "good morning"
  "good evening"
  "how are you"
  "how are you doing today"
  "greetings"
  "what's up"
  "hi there"
  "nice to meet you"
  "just dropping by to say hello"

define user ask academic question
  "hi can you explain this concept from the lecture"
  "hello Nova I have a question about my midterm exam"
  "hey can you help me solve this math problem"
  "good morning how do I approach this business case study"
  "hello could you explain this scientific theory"
  "explain the laws of thermodynamics in physics"
  "how does cellular respiration work in biology"
  "can you explain organic chemistry reaction mechanisms"
  "how do I calculate eigenvalues in linear algebra"
  "help me solve this differential equation step by step"
  "how do electrical circuits and Kirchhoff laws work"
  "explain stress and strain analysis in structural mechanics"
  "what is the mechanism of action of this antibiotic in pharmacology"
  "describe the anatomical structures of the human heart"
  "what is the difference between microeconomics and macroeconomics"
  "how do I prepare a balance sheet and income statement in accounting"
  "explain Porters five forces model in corporate strategy"
  "what are the fundamental principles of constitutional law"
  "explain Piagets stages of cognitive development in psychology"
  "summarize the main causes of the Industrial Revolution in history"
  "how do I structure a formal literature review for my research paper"
  "help me debug this programming code for my assignment"
  "what are the graduation requirements and credit hours"
  "what is the minimum GPA to avoid academic probation"
  "what are the course withdrawal rules and deadlines"
  "what is the prerequisite course for this subject"
  "summarize lecture 3 and key formulas from the textbook"
  "can you give me practice questions to prepare for finals"

define flow academic question
  user ask academic question
  bot pass to graph

define flow greeting
  user express greeting
  bot express greeting
  stop

define bot express greeting
  "Hello! I am Nova, your AI academic tutor at EduHub. How can I assist you with your studies today?"

define user ask off topic
  "how to cook pasta carbonara"
  "recipe for homemade pizza"
  "best chocolate cake recipe"
  "who won the football match yesterday"
  "latest scores and standings in the premier league"
  "who is the best basketball player in the NBA"
  "recommend a good action movie on Netflix"
  "tell me about the latest Marvel film"
  "celebrity news and gossip"
  "tell me a funny joke to make me laugh"
  "tell me an interesting riddle"
  "what is the weather forecast for tomorrow"
  "is it going to rain this weekend"
  "top tourist attractions in Paris"
  "who is the president of France"
  "latest political news and headlines"
  "write a romantic love poem for my partner"
  "tips for car maintenance and changing engine oil"
  "how do I fix a leaking bathroom pipe"
  "what does my horoscope say for today"

define flow off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic
  stop

define bot refuse off topic
  "I am an academic assistant dedicated to answering questions about courses, curriculum, and university regulations at EduHub. Please ask an academic question related to your studies."
